Package: vabaxos-settings
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf-cli
Recommends: vabaxos-start, vabaxos-branding
Description: VabaxOS default settings for GNOME
 Defaults that keep the desktop usable without sight (ADR-0004,
 ADR-0014): no GNOME welcome tour, no automatic suspend, no screen lock
 that asks for a password, a quick shutdown of the user session, and
 the extension vabaxos-keys@vabaxos.org: the keys of Windows 11, and the
 Start button and search box of the taskbar, which open the VabaxOS Start
 menu (ADR-0025).
